WEBVTT

00:00:14.425 --> 00:00:15.948
Come with me.
跟我走

00:00:18.821 --> 00:00:20.518
Here, boy! Catch!
这边 好孩子 快去捡

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:22.825
[PANTING]
我们在这儿

00:00:22.868 --> 00:00:24.435
GRAN: Yoo-hoo!
我们在这儿

00:00:24.478 --> 00:00:25.697
Gran?
[GIGGLES]
外婆

00:00:28.265 --> 00:00:29.396
Mom?
妈

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:30.833
Wow.
哇

00:00:32.443 --> 00:00:33.792
Grug?
咕噜呢

00:00:34.532 --> 00:00:35.925
[BLOWS WEAKLY]

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:37.100
[SIGHS]

00:00:38.841 --> 00:00:40.146
[GRUNTS]

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:43.367
I'll go get him.
我去找他

00:00:46.065 --> 00:00:47.284
[EXHALES]

00:00:49.678 --> 00:00:51.984
THUNK: Oh, good boy!
Who's a good boy?
好孩子 谁最乖了

00:00:52.028 --> 00:00:54.160
You are! Yes, you are!
Look at you!
你最乖了 对啊 你看看你

00:00:54.204 --> 00:00:56.119
You need a name.
You want a name?
我要帮你取名字 你想要名字吗

00:00:56.162 --> 00:00:58.034
I'm going to call
you Douglas.
我要叫你道格拉斯

00:00:58.077 --> 00:01:00.471
Can you do tricks?
Roll over.
你会玩把戏吗 翻身

00:01:00.514 --> 00:01:02.429
Come on, Douglas,
roll over.
过来 道格拉斯 翻身

00:01:07.391 --> 00:01:09.436
Good boy, Douglas!
好孩子 道格拉斯

00:01:13.049 --> 00:01:14.790
I was in love once.
[SIGHS]
我谈过一次恋爱

00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:17.793
He was a hunter.
I was a gatherer.
他是猎人 我是采集者

00:01:17.836 --> 00:01:21.013
It was quite a scandal.
那是一个丑闻

00:01:21.057 --> 00:01:24.538
We fed each other
berries, we danced.
我们喂对方吃浆果 我们还跳舞

00:01:24.582 --> 00:01:26.279
Then my father
smashed him with a rock
后来我爸把他摔到岩石上

00:01:26.323 --> 00:01:28.107
and traded me
to your grandfather.
用我和你外公换东西

00:01:28.151 --> 00:01:29.456
[ALL LAUGHING]

00:01:32.764 --> 00:01:34.461
Croods!
古鲁家族

00:01:34.505 --> 00:01:35.854
Get down here.
到下面来

00:01:35.898 --> 00:01:38.814
Grug, they're okay.
Guy is with them.
咕噜 他们没事 阿盖和他们在一起

00:01:38.857 --> 00:01:41.512
Oh? Guy is with them.
Oh. Phew! Okay.
阿盖和他们在一起 真好啊

00:01:41.991 --> 00:01:43.470
Ha! Thank you.
真是谢了

00:01:43.514 --> 00:01:47.518
Thank you for bringing me
that interesting Guy update.
谢谢你告诉我有趣的阿盖的新消息

00:01:47.561 --> 00:01:49.346
Oh, okay.
I'm going to go up...
好吧 我要去上面了

00:01:49.389 --> 00:01:54.046
and why don't
you join us when you
stop being a big drag!
等你不那么机车再加入我们吧

00:01:57.571 --> 00:01:58.572
[SIGHS]

00:02:01.227 --> 00:02:02.272
Uh, uh...
要堆起来睡吗

00:02:02.315 --> 00:02:03.839
Sleep pile?
要堆起来睡吗

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:10.280
How about a story? Huh?
要听故事吗

00:02:10.323 --> 00:02:11.585
[ALL LAUGHING]

00:02:12.499 --> 00:02:13.805
Anyone?
有人想听吗

00:02:16.373 --> 00:02:20.464
And then Torg said,
"Know it? I drew it."
「你知道吗 那是我画的」

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:22.118
[ALL LAUGHING]
「你知道吗 那是我画的」

00:02:22.161 --> 00:02:24.033
That makes no sense.
这不合理啊

00:02:24.076 --> 00:02:25.730
[BOTH LAUGHING]
我知道你带着我们很辛苦

00:02:25.774 --> 00:02:28.907
I know
it was hard for you
to bring us along...
我知道你带着我们很辛苦

00:02:28.951 --> 00:02:31.867
but they had
the best day
of their lives.
不过这是他们这辈子最开心的一天

00:02:33.216 --> 00:02:35.653
Thank you for that.
谢谢你这么做

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:38.090
[ANIMALS SCREECHING
IN DISTANCE]

00:02:39.788 --> 00:02:41.224
[THUNDER RUMBLING]

00:02:57.936 --> 00:03:00.547
I want to show
you something.
我要给你们看个东西

00:03:24.136 --> 00:03:25.224
[BLOWS]

00:03:40.979 --> 00:03:43.939
More suns in the sky
than you can count.
天空里的太阳多得数不清

00:03:43.982 --> 00:03:48.204
GUY: Every sun
that crosses our sky
comes to rest up there.
每一个经过天空的太阳都在这里休息

00:03:48.247 --> 00:03:50.162
Tomorrow.
明天

00:03:50.206 --> 00:03:52.034
That's where
we'll be safe.
我们在那里会很安全

00:03:52.904 --> 00:03:54.993
I'm going with Guy.
我要和阿盖一起走

00:03:55.037 --> 00:03:57.648
No. Not my little girl.
不 我的小宝贝不能走

00:04:01.957 --> 00:04:04.046
Come with us.
和我们一起走吧

00:04:04.089 --> 00:04:05.743
I can't go without Grug.
我不能留下咕噜

00:04:05.787 --> 00:04:08.572
That makes one of us.
Count me in.
但我可以 我跟你们走

00:04:08.615 --> 00:04:10.400
Really, Mom? Now?
真的吗 妈 你说现在

00:04:10.443 --> 00:04:12.794
GRAN: Grug has no idea
how to protect us.
咕噜不知道怎么保护我们

00:04:12.837 --> 00:04:15.013
In fact,
he has no ideas at all!
事实上 他根本什么都不知道

00:04:15.057 --> 00:04:18.147
UGGA: No, that's not true.
What about that
one time when he...
不是的 上次他还...

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.496
Uh...
[STAMMERS]

00:04:20.279 --> 00:04:21.672
Oh, face it.
面对现实吧

00:04:21.715 --> 00:04:24.849
If he actually had
an idea of his own...
如果他真的有自己的点子

00:04:24.893 --> 00:04:27.112
I'd have a heart
attack and die!
我就会心脏病发死掉了

00:04:32.639 --> 00:04:33.684
Grug?
咕噜

00:04:33.727 --> 00:04:35.294
THUNK: Dad!
EEP: Dad!
老爸 -老爸

00:04:35.338 --> 00:04:38.341
He's a big guy.
How could he just
disappear like that?
怎么可能就这样不见

00:04:38.384 --> 00:04:41.997
Hey, wait!
Let's ask that ugly lady
if she's seen Dad.
等一下 我们问那个丑女人

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:43.128
Huh?
我没看到他

00:04:43.172 --> 00:04:44.564
Haven't seen him.
我没看到他

00:04:44.608 --> 00:04:47.002
Ah!
What are you doing?
你在干嘛

00:04:47.045 --> 00:04:48.786
Yeah. Wow.
这个嘛

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:52.050
I was up all night,
because all these ideas
just kept coming to me.
我整晚没睡 因为有好多点子

00:04:52.094 --> 00:04:53.878
Um, is that a snake?
那是条蛇吗

00:04:53.922 --> 00:04:56.185
Belt,
new and improved.
是皮带 新的而且还更好

00:04:56.228 --> 00:04:57.839
[GROWLS]
而且会自己变紧喔

00:04:57.882 --> 00:05:00.450
Ow! It's even
self-tightening!
而且会自己变紧喔

00:05:00.493 --> 00:05:01.538
Ow!
而且会自己变紧喔

00:05:01.581 --> 00:05:03.453
What is that
on your head?
你头上那是什么

00:05:03.496 --> 00:05:05.542
It's called desperation.
这叫做「绝望」

00:05:05.585 --> 00:05:08.110
I call it a "rug."
Rhymes with "Grug."
这叫做「裹毯」 和「咕噜」押韵

00:05:08.153 --> 00:05:11.287
And this one,
I call it a "ride."
这个叫做「车车」

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:12.636
Rhymes with "Grug."
和「咕噜」也押韵

00:05:12.679 --> 00:05:14.290
Uh, that doesn't rhyme--
没有押韵啊

00:05:14.333 --> 00:05:16.161
It's going to get us
places faster than shoes.
[CHUCKLES]
这会比我们穿鞋移动得更快

00:05:16.945 --> 00:05:18.816
Yeah! Try to keep up!
厉害吧 想办法跟上我吧

00:05:19.382 --> 00:05:20.557
[GRUG GRUNTING]

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:21.863
[SCREAMS]

00:05:22.733 --> 00:05:23.734
GRUG: Oh!

00:05:24.953 --> 00:05:26.998
I wish I had a ride.
我也想要车车

00:05:27.042 --> 00:05:29.696
GRUG: And painting
is a thing of the past.
画画是过去的事了

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:32.221
I call this
a "snapshot."
这叫做「快照」

00:05:32.264 --> 00:05:33.439
[GROANS]
再来一次 我好像眨眼了

00:05:33.483 --> 00:05:35.572
Oh, let's do it again.
I think I blinked.
再来一次 我好像眨眼了

00:05:36.878 --> 00:05:39.228
I call them "shades."
这叫做「阴影」

00:05:39.271 --> 00:05:41.360
The sun doesn't hurt
my eyes anymore.
太阳不会让我眼睛痛了

00:05:41.404 --> 00:05:43.275
Where do you get
these great ideas?
你怎么想到这些点子的

00:05:43.319 --> 00:05:44.755
Since I don't
have a brain...
既然我没有脑袋

00:05:44.798 --> 00:05:47.323
they're coming
from my stomach,
down deep below...
那就是从我的胃想到的 从下面这边

00:05:47.366 --> 00:05:49.542
and then up again
into my mind.
[GROANS]
然后往上到我的头

00:05:50.543 --> 00:05:52.328
[SCREAMS]
咕噜 我们得继续前进了

00:05:52.371 --> 00:05:54.634
Grug, we have
to keep moving.
咕噜 我们得继续前进了

00:05:54.678 --> 00:05:57.420
See, I got ideas.
I got thoughts.
看吧 我也有点子 我有想法

00:05:57.463 --> 00:06:00.597
Like this. I call it
a "mobile home."
就像这样 这叫做「移动住宅」

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:02.338
Isn't that something?
很厉害吧

00:06:03.165 --> 00:06:05.297
[GRUNTS]

00:06:05.341 --> 00:06:07.952
And I'm calling this
one a "lifterator."
我说这叫做「板翘翘」

00:06:07.996 --> 00:06:09.084
Mom?
妈

00:06:09.127 --> 00:06:10.302
I know.
It's bad.
我知道 这很烂

00:06:10.999 --> 00:06:11.956
[SCREAMS]

00:06:13.305 --> 00:06:14.350
ALL: Ooh!

00:06:14.393 --> 00:06:16.482
I almost feel
sorry for him.
我都要同情他了

00:06:17.092 --> 00:06:18.310
[GRUG GROANS]

00:06:19.050 --> 00:06:20.443
[SQUISHES]
ALL: Oh!

00:06:21.313 --> 00:06:23.707
[CHUCKLES]
No, I don't.
不 我才不会

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.839
UGGA: What are you
trying to do, Grug?
你到底想干嘛 咕噜

00:06:25.883 --> 00:06:30.105
GRUG: [SIGHS]
See, I thought
if I could have ideas...
听我说 我觉得如果我像阿盖一样

00:06:30.148 --> 00:06:32.324
like Guy...
uh...
可以想出点子

00:06:32.368 --> 00:06:34.631
maybe Eep
would listen to me.
也许一妹就会听我的

00:06:34.674 --> 00:06:38.504
And maybe she wouldn't
want to go with Guy.
也许她就不会想和阿盖走

00:06:38.548 --> 00:06:40.028
Oh, Grug.
咕噜

00:06:40.071 --> 00:06:42.595
Is that what
this is all about?
原来是这么一回事

00:06:43.335 --> 00:06:44.554
[SIGHS]

00:06:45.947 --> 00:06:49.254
And I also thought
it would kill your mother.
我也觉得这样可以杀了你老妈

00:06:49.298 --> 00:06:51.909
So win-win.
是双赢啊

00:06:51.953 --> 00:06:53.345
GUY: We're here!
我们到了

00:07:00.483 --> 00:07:01.788
Wow.

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:03.660
Wow.
哇

00:07:04.095 --> 00:07:05.140
[GASPS]

00:07:05.183 --> 00:07:06.750
[BIRDS CAWING OVERHEAD]

